{"ref":"BDB, קָרְחָה","hw":"קָרְחָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְחָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְחָא</span></big>  <strong>n.f. baldness, bald spot</strong>, made in mourning;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְחָתֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:16\" href=\"/Micah.1.16\">Mi 1:16</a>;—<em>bald spot</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־כָּל־רֹאשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 8:10\" href=\"/Amos.8.10\">Am 8:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָל־ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.2\">Is 15:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.18\">Ez 7:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ בְּרֹאשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.5\">Lv 21:5</a> (acc. cogn.); <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־רֹאשׁ ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.37\">Je 48:37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ כַּנֶּשֶׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:16\" href=\"/Micah.1.16\">Mi 1:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּין עֵינֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.1\">Dt 14:1</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעֲשֶׂה מִקְשֶׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.24\">Is 3:24</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.5\">Je 47:5</a> and (acc. cogn.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.31\">Ez 27:31</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(קָרְחָא)</span>.","next":"BDB, קָרַ֫חַת","prev":"BDB, קֵרֵחַ"}